SUMMARY:[Control & Robotics][Reinforcement Learning] ICRA 2027 - Extended p
 aper submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: IEEE International Conference on Robotics and
  Automation\nWebsite: https://2027.ieee-icra.org/\nSource URL: https://20
 27.ieee-icra.org/announcements/call-for-papers-submission-deadline-extend
 ed/\nLocation: Seoul\, South Korea\nTopics: Control & Robotics\, Reinforc
 ement Learning\, Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition\, System Identific
 ation & Data-driven Dynamics\nSize: XXL\nSubmission type: Paper-based\nCo
 nfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Official Septe
 mber 16 extension notice states new deadline September 16 at 23:59 PST\; 
 preserve its literal UTC-8 even though local September civil time is PDT.
  Fresh-paper submissions are closed. Optional videos and final uploads do
  not reopen them. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Robotics and aut
 omation across perception\, motion and manipulation\, planning and contro
 l\, human-robot interaction\, and autonomous systems. Learning-based robo
 tics\, reinforcement and imitation learning\, and data-driven models are 
 relevant when they advance physical robotic capability. Generic ML with n
 o robotics connection is not the core remit.\nAdditional topics: Planning
  & Search\, Deep Representation Learning\, Human-AI Interaction & Deploym
 ent\, Robustness & Safety\nScope sources (2027): https://2027.ieee-icra.o
 rg/contribute/call-for-icra-2027-papers-now-accepting-submissions/\nScope
  last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://2027.ieee-icra.org/announcements/call-for-papers-submission-dea
 dline-extended/
END:VEVENT
