UID:rss-2027-deadline-extended-abstract@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART:20261205T115900Z
DTEND:20261205T125900Z
SUMMARY:[Control & Robotics][Reinforcement Learning] RSS 2027 - Stage 1 ext
 ended abstract submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Robotics: Science and Systems\nWebsite: https
 ://roboticsconference.org/\nSource URL: https://roboticsconference.org/in
 formation/cfp/\nLocation: Athens\, Greece\nTopics: Control & Robotics\, R
 einforcement Learning\, System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics\, Co
 mputer Vision & Pattern Recognition\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-base
 d\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: New two-s
 tage 2027 process requires a six-page initial submission by December 4\, 
 2026. Only authors invited after review may submit the April final paper\
 ; it is not a fresh-paper route after stage 1 closes. Size is an editoria
 l estimate.\nScope: Focused robotics research linking perception\, learni
 ng\, planning\, control\, manipulation\, and robot-system science. Reinfo
 rcement and imitation learning\, model-based behavior\, and reliable auto
 nomous systems are characteristic intersections. The 2027 review process 
 emphasizes a scientifically developed robotic hypothesis through gated in
 itial and invited final submissions.\nAdditional topics: Planning & Searc
 h\, Deep Representation Learning\, Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty M
 L\, Robustness & Safety\nScope sources (2027): https://roboticsconference
 .org/information/cfp/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://roboticsconference.org/information/cfp/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:icaps-2027-deadline-abstract@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART:20261208T115900Z
DTEND:20261208T125900Z
SUMMARY:[Planning & Search][Knowledge Representation & Reasoning] ICAPS 202
 7 - Paper abstract registration deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Conference on Automated Plannin
 g and Scheduling\nWebsite: https://icaps27.icaps-conference.org/\nSource 
 URL: https://icaps27.icaps-conference.org/calls/cfp/\nLocation: Columbia\
 , South Carolina\, USA\nTopics: Planning & Search\, Knowledge Representat
 ion & Reasoning\, Machine Learning\, Control & Robotics\nSize: M\nSubmiss
 ion type: Long and short papers / automated planning\nConfidence: confirm
 ed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Official CFP confirms the meeti
 ng and 23:59 UTC-12 abstract/paper deadlines. Learning and foundation-mod
 el papers require a substantive planning or scheduling contribution\; rei
 nforcement learning alone is explicitly outside the main-track scope. M i
 s an editorial size estimate.\nScope: Automated planning and scheduling\,
  heuristic search\, constraint-based reasoning\, temporal and hierarchica
 l planning\, and planning under uncertainty. Learning and foundation mode
 ls fit when they substantially advance planning or scheduling\, including
  model acquisition and search guidance. The main CFP explicitly excludes 
 reinforcement-learning papers without a substantive planning contribution
 \; general reward-based learning is not a blanket tag.\nAdditional topics
 : Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty ML\nScope sources (2027): https://
 icaps27.icaps-conference.org/calls/cfp/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://icaps27.icaps-conference.org/calls/cfp/
END:VEVENT
